# A link in a message tapped (App.kt's UriHandler): handed to the system's browser (macOS: said on the log only, a
# scripted run opens nothing; Android: ACTION_VIEW); a chat's own link opens the chat in the app instead.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap 发消息
type 给个链接 {T} md:链接 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
gone 正在发送
timeout 120000
until example.com/e2e
wait 1500
shot 1-before
# (tapped, the run ends: on Android the browser comes in front and the app is no longer drawn; the check reads the log)
tap example.com/e2e
